Source: machine-whoami
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Bryan Wann <bwann@wann.net>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.0

Package: machine-whoami
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, systemd
Description: Generate per-machine identity files from Netbox
 machine_whoami fetches device metadata from Netbox and writes per-machine
 identity files in bash-compatible NAME=VALUE format. Designed for fleets
 up to 100,000 devices across many sites/regions.
